WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.069 --> 00:00:03.160
Yippee-ki-yay, movie lovers, it's Jan here!

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:07.270
You may know Margot Robbie best as Leonardo
DiCaprio's on-screen wife in Wolf Of Wall

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:12.140
Street or the mallet-wielding Harley Quinn
in Suicide Squad, but before she hit the big

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:16.270
time, the talented Australian actress made
a crust working at the fast-food chain Subway.

00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:20.590
Thanks to a regular role in the Aussie soap
opera Neighbours, however, Robbie, whose nickname

00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:25.900
is maggot, was able to say so-long to serving
sandwiches, and hello to future cinematic

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:26.900
stardom.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:31.019
Now, to mark Robbie's latest big-screen outing,
I've put together 7 crazy, cool facts you

00:00:31.019 --> 00:00:36.000
need to know about the trapeze-swinging, tattoo-giving
actress!

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.890
Robbie is a mega sports fan and when she moved
from Australia to the US in 2011 to star in

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:46.450
the TV drama series Pan Am, she captained
a softball team she formed with her co-stars,

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:50.430
and loved giving them pep talks and painting
their faces before each game!

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:54.289
Once in the States, Robbie also became part
of an amateur ice-hockey team.

00:00:54.289 --> 00:00:58.379
And her experience in the rink could well
come in handy on screen as one of the movie's

00:00:58.379 --> 00:01:03.050
that Robbie has lined up to star in is a biopic
of former figure skater Tonya Harding.

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:06.420
Robbie will also produce the movie through
her own production company, called LuckyChap

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:10.500
Entertainment, which she set up with some
of her housemates including childhood friend

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:15.320
and assistant Sophia Kerr and Robbie's boyfriend,
assistant director Tom Ackerley, who she met

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:20.780
while filming the World War Two movie Suite
Française in 2013.

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:24.520
While she was filming The Legend of Tarzan
in the UK with Harry Potter director David

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:29.549
Yates and True Blood star Alexander Skarsgård,
Robbie turned 24 years old, and celebrated

00:01:29.549 --> 00:01:33.140
her birthday in style by holding a 24-hour-long
party!

00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:37.810
The carousing kicked off with champagne at
home at 9am, continued with games in London's

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:42.470
Hyde Park, and was followed by burgers and
bar-hopping, and even included under-the-sea

00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:47.200
and Western-themed costumes, and it all came
to a close with more champagne back at home

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:50.030
24 hours later!

00:01:50.030 --> 00:01:54.210
After a night partying with friends in London,
Robbie got a call to audition for Wolf Of

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:55.689
Wall Street in New York!

00:01:55.689 --> 00:02:00.000
But when she turned up later that day wearing
jeans and flat boots to meet the movie's casting

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.869
director Ellen Lewis, Lewis sent her away
to buy a tight dress and super-high heels.

00:02:04.869 --> 00:02:09.080
When it came to the audition itself, Leonardo
DiCaprio's ad libs almost threw Robbie off

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:13.980
course until she decided to take a risk and
responded to his improvised 'now get over

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:17.970
here and kiss me' line by smacking him right
in the face!

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:22.350
DiCaprio and director Martin Scorsese had
a good laugh about it, and that dramatic performance

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:25.040
sealed the role for her.

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:28.880
Actually, Robbie seems to be getting a bit
of a rep for beating up her co-stars!

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:33.550
In the war comedy-drama Whiskey Tango Foxtrot,
there's a scene where Robbie's character playfully

00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:35.831
punches Tina Fey and says 'We're going out
tonight!'

00:02:35.831 --> 00:02:40.190
According to Fey, Robbie was so strong from
all the physical training she was doing for

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:44.550
Suicide Squad that her on-camera punch left
a huge bruise on Fey's arm, which lasted for

00:02:44.550 --> 00:02:45.910
several days.

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:49.470
And then there's the sex scene Robbie filmed
with Alexander Skarsgård for The Legend of

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:54.030
Tarzan, which, according to Skarsgård, who
plays Tarzan, was the only time he got injured

00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:55.460
during the whole shoot!

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:59.560
Apparently, director David Yates wanted the
scene to have an animalistic quality so was

00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:02.810
encouraging Robbie to beat Skarsgård up!

00:03:02.810 --> 00:03:06.990
Going back to Wolf Of Wall Street, Martin
Scorsese gave Robbie the option of wearing

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:11.122
a robe or underwear for that scene where she
seduces Leonardo DiCaprio's character in her

00:03:11.122 --> 00:03:13.440
apartment wearing nothing but stockings and
high heels.

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:18.370
But Robbie refused, saying that her character
Naomi would be completely naked as her body

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:20.790
was her only form of currency in that world.

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:25.000
Still, Robbie was in need of some Dutch courage
to film those sex scenes, so knocked back

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.500
several shots of tequila before hitting the
set.

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:32.220
Oh, and by the way, many of those clingy outfits
Robbie wore in her other scenes actually belonged

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:36.000
to the movie's Oscar-winning costume designer
Sandy Powell, who originally wore them in

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.450
the 1990s!

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:42.840
If she wasn't an actress, Robbie says she'd
like to be a trapeze artist, which isn't quite

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:46.940
as weird as it might sound at first because
she actually has experience in that particular

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:50.780
area since, as a kid growing up in Australia,
she attended circus school.

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:54.900
And when she was just eight years old, she
even got her trapeze certificate, and took

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:59.860
it up again recently practising in classes
at Santa Monica Pier.

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:04.680
During the shoot for Suicide Squad, Robbie
really got into her crazy Harley Quinn character,

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:08.730
setting up her own Tattoo Parlour on set and
inking the word Skwad on to her co-stars'

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:09.730
arms.

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:13.430
But Robbie's penchant for tattoos and fascination
with needles goes back further.

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:17.480
A few years ago when she started living in
a shared house in London, she decided to make

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:20.840
it a rule that everyone living there had to
get a tattoo.

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:24.890
Then when her housemate and now boyfriend
Tom Ackerley was getting his tattoo done at

00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:30.070
the local tattoo parlour, Robbie persuaded
him to let her take over from the tattoo artist!

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:33.600
After The Legend of Tarzan finished filming,
a friend of Robbie's gave her a tattoo gun

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:38.750
as a present, which she used to tattoo a journalist
during an interview and her Suicide Squad

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:39.750
co-stars!

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:42.220
So guys, which are your favourite Margot Robbie
movies?

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:44.980
And what would you like to see in a Harley
Quinn spin-off film?

